     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRInformantLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRInformantLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRInformantLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html\">Logical model - FR LM Informant</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html\">CDA - informant</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant\">FRLMInformant</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html#s-Informant\">Informant</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantProfessional\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantProfessional</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html#s-Informant.assignedEntity\">Informant.assignedEntity</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'informateur professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantOrganisation\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantOrganisation</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html#s-Informant.assignedEntity\">Informant.assignedEntity</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>L'informateur structure est de type FRLMOrganisation, cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html#s-Informant.assignedEntity\">Informant.assignedEntity</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Cas où informantPersonne[x] référence un FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-informant.html#s-Informant.relatedEntity\">Informant.relatedEntity</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Cas où informantPersonne[x] référence un FRLMRelatedPerson, cf. FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html\">Logical model - FR LM Informant</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU