.ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-informant-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:party.value[x]\">Extension.extension:party.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Cas où informantPersonne[x] référence un FRLMPatient (Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Patient)) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMInformant.html#s-FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]\">FRLMInformant.informant[x].informantPersonne[x]</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-informant-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:party.value[x]\">Extension.extension:party.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Cas où informantPersonne[x] référence un FRLMRelatedPerson (Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(RelatedPerson)) — cf. FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table></div>"
